{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100008","id":2215203018,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ECVDK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100008","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100008.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100008.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100008","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100008/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100008/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100008/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5318008ce6a52fa3af7f466189a263d4905c76fa","number":100008,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"thorvg: Update to 0.15.5","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.5\r\n<details open>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\n- [Renderer] Fixed an issue where paint transformations were omitted during scene changes.\r\n- [Renderer] Added support for the SceneEffect DropShadow feature, enhancing visual depth with shadow effects.\r\n- [GlEngine] Resolved incorrect stroke alpha calculation.\r\n- [Lottie] Added support for the DropShadow layer effect, enhancing Lottie animations with shadow options.\r\n- [Lottie] Added support for min/max easing and shapes for text range selectors.\r\n- [Lottie] Addressed a minor bug in trimpath expressions.\r\n- [Lottie] Improved slot overriding, ensuring duplicate keyframe data is handled correctly.\r\n- [Lottie] Enhanced Lottie parser stability.\r\n- [SVG] Corrected handling of the \"currentColor\" attribute within gradients.\r\n- [Portability] Fixed a compilation issue with LVGL integration.\r\n- [Example] Resolved resource leaks in GL and WebGPU canvases by refining usage guidance.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.4\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\n- [SwEngine] Enhanced minor stability for a smoother user experience.\r\n- [GlEngine] Introduced support for radial gradient focal functions, enabling more versatile gradient designs.\r\n- [GlEngine] Resolved performance degradation caused by repeated clip drawing operations.\r\n- [Lottie] Revised gradient fill data parsing by adding support for the color stop count (p) parameter in slot data.\r\n- [Lottie] Implemented support for overriding default slots.\r\n- [Lottie] Enhanced slots to correctly override solid fill opacity and image attributes.\r\n- [Lottie] Added support for text alignment options, improving text layout flexibility.\r\n- [Lottie] Enabled smoothness and maxAmount specification for text range selectors.\r\n- [Lottie] Fixed minor memory leaks to ensure better resource handling.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.3\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\n- [Renderer] Hotfixed an issue with broken SVG file sharing.\r\n- [SwEngine] Fixed an issue with Gaussian Blur feathering when applied in one directional filter.\r\n- [SwEngine] Fixed a regression bug that impacted rendering regions.\r\n- [Lottie] Adjusted Text Range Selector transformation to ensure accurate positioning.\r\n- [Lottie] Corrected a shallow keyframe data copy bug.\r\n- [SVG] Enhanced runtime stability by preventing invalid memory access.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.2\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\n- [SwEngine] Optimized render region updates to minimize unnecessary rendering tasks.\r\n- [SwEngine] Fixed a crash by splitting long lines to prevent overflow.\r\n- [SwEngine] Fixed incorrect 8bits linear gradient filling masking.\r\n- [SwEngine] Rectified a wrong 8bits channel data blending in direct image drawing.\r\n- [GlEngine] Added support for the Path Trimming feature.\r\n- [GlEngine] Fixed an wrong png colorspace.\r\n- [GlEngine] Corrected a wrong masking alpha multiplication when applying the Inverse Luma Masking.\r\n- [Lottie] Enhanced performance for Gaussian Blur effects.\r\n- [Lottie] Added support for Masking Expansion (Dilate).\r\n- [Lottie] Optimized memory management by releasing JSON data immediately after loading.\r\n- [Lottie] Fixed regression bugs causing gradient fills to matte masked, incorrectly.\r\n- [Lottie] Rectified Offset Path to ignore the path direction according to its Spec.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.1\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\n- [Lottie] Fixed a crash when the image external path is not addressed.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v0.15.0\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Changes</summary>\r\n\r\nToo many to list, just click the link above 😬\r\n</details>\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://